<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Autonomous Agent Studio - Financial Analysis</title>
<style>
:root {
  --primary: #3b82f6;
  --primary-dark: #1e40af;
  --secondary: #8b5cf6;
  --accent: #ec4899;
  --success: #10b981;
  --warning: #f59e0b;
  --danger: #ef4444;
  
  --bg-dark: #0f172a;
  --bg-darker: #0a0e27;
  --bg-card: #1e293b;
  --bg-input: #1a2641;
  
  --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
  --text-secondary: #cbd5e1;
  --text-muted: #94a3b8;
  
  --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html, body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-dark) 0%, var(--bg-darker) 100%);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  min-height: 100vh;
  background-attachment: fixed;
}

body { padding: 0; }

.app {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

/* HEADER */
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.15), rgba(139,92,246,0.08));
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 24px 20px;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

.header-content {
  max-width: 1400px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.header-left h1 {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
}

.header-subtitle {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.header-status {
  display: flex;
  gap: 24px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.status-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}

.status-label {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.status-value {
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
}

/* MAIN CONTAINER */
.container {
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 1400px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 32px 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 350px;
  gap: 24px;
}

/* LEFT PANEL */
.left-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 24px;
}

/* SETUP SECTION */
.setup-section {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 24px;
}

.section-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.input-group {
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.input-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  display: block;
}

textarea {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px;
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
  min-height: 120px;
  resize: vertical;
}

textarea:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
}

.btn-start {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  border: none;
  color: white;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 13px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.btn-start:hover:not(:disabled) {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
}

.btn-start:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

/* WORKFLOW VISUALIZATION */
.workflow-section {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 24px;
}

.workflow-diagram {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 200px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

.workflow-description {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
  background: var(--bg-input);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
}

/* EXECUTION PANEL */
.execution-section {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 24px;
  max-height: 600px;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.execution-log {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}

.log-entry {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.log-entry.active {
  border-left-color: var(--secondary);
  background: rgba(139,92,246,0.1);
}

.log-entry.error {
  border-left-color: var(--danger);
  background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.log-entry.success {
  border-left-color: var(--success);
  background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1);
  color: var(--success);
}

.log-timestamp {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.2px;
}

.log-message {
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

/* ANALYSIS OUTPUT */
.analysis-output {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 24px;
  max-height: 600px;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.output-section {
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.output-heading {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.output-text {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.7;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* RIGHT PANEL (SIDEBAR) */
.right-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 24px;
  height: fit-content;
  position: sticky;
  top: 120px;
}

.info-card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
}

.info-card-title {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.info-item {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 8px 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.info-item:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.info-label {
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.info-value {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

/* PROGRESS BAR */
.progress-container {
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.progress-bar {
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border-radius: 3px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  animation: fillWidth 0.6s ease;
}

@keyframes fillWidth {
  from { width: 0; }
  to { width: var(--width); }
}

/* ITERATION HISTORY */
.history-item {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.history-item.current {
  border-left-color: var(--secondary);
  background: rgba(139,92,246,0.1);
}

.history-round {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.history-metric {
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.history-metric strong {
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

/* LOADING SPINNER */
.spinner {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3);
  border-top-color: var(--primary);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes spin {
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

/* BADGES */
.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
}

.badge-success {
  background: rgba(16,185,129,0.2);
  color: var(--success);
}

.badge-warning {
  background: rgba(245,158,11,0.2);
  color: var(--warning);
}

.badge-info {
  background: rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
  color: var(--primary);
}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .container {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .right-panel {
    position: relative;
    top: auto;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .header-content {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .header-status {
    width: 100%;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .container {
    padding: 16px;
  }
}

/* HIDDEN */
.hidden {
  display: none !important;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="app">
  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-content">
      <div class="header-left">
        <h1>🤖 Autonomous Agent Studio</h1>
        <div class="header-subtitle">Multi-Agent Financial Analysis Pipeline</div>
      </div>
      <div class="header-status">
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="status-label">Status</div>
          <div class="status-value" id="headerStatus">Ready</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="status-label">Round</div>
          <div class="status-value" id="headerRound">—</div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-item">
          <div class="status-label">Agent</div>
          <div class="status-value" id="headerAgent">—</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CONTAINER -->
  <div class="container">
    <!-- LEFT PANEL -->
    <div class="left-panel">
      <!-- SETUP SECTION -->
      <div class="setup-section" id="setupSection">
        <div class="section-title">📊 Financial Data Input</div>
        <div class="input-group">
          <label class="input-label">Paste CSV or financial data (sample will be provided):</label>
          <textarea id="csvInput" placeholder="Date,Revenue,Expenses,Profit&#10;2024-01-01,50000,30000,20000&#10;2024-02-01,52000,31000,21000&#10;..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-start" id="startBtn" onclick="startAnalysis()">Start Multi-Agent Analysis</button>
      </div>

      <!-- WORKFLOW VISUALIZATION -->
      <div class="workflow-section">
        <div class="section-title">🔄 Agent Workflow Loop</div>
        <div class="workflow-diagram">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 250" style="max-width: 100%;">
            <!-- Executor -->
            <rect x="140" y="20" width="120" height="50" rx="8" fill="#3b82f6" opacity="0.2" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="200" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3b82f6" font-weight="bold" font-size="12">Executor</text>
            
            <!-- Down arrow -->
            <path d="M 200 70 L 200 100" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
            
            <!-- Evaluator -->
            <rect x="140" y="100" width="120" height="50" rx="8" fill="#8b5cf6" opacity="0.2" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="200" y="130" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b5cf6" font-weight="bold" font-size="12">Evaluator</text>
            
            <!-- Down arrow -->
            <path d="M 200 150 L 200 180" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
            
            <!-- Critic + Improver -->
            <rect x="30" y="180" width="120" height="50" rx="8" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.2" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="90" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ec4899" font-weight="bold" font-size="12">Critic</text>
            
            <rect x="250" y="180" width="120" height="50" rx="8" fill="#f59e0b" opacity="0.2" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="310" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f59e0b" font-weight="bold" font-size="12">Improver</text>
            
            <!-- Loop back -->
            <path d="M 90 180 Q 90 120 140 120" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-green)"/>
            <text x="70" y="150" font-size="10" fill="#10b981" font-weight="bold">Loop</text>
            
            <!-- Final Reviewer (branch) -->
            <path d="M 200 150 L 200 160 L 360 160 L 360 180" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-green)"/>
            <rect x="290" y="180" width="140" height="50" rx="8" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.2" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="360" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#10b981" font-weight="bold" font-size="12">Final Reviewer</text>
            
            <!-- Arrow markers -->
            <defs>
              <marker id="arrowhead" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="5" refY="5" orient="auto">
                <polygon points="0 0, 10 5, 0 10" fill="#3b82f6"/>
              </marker>
              <marker id="arrowhead-green" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="5" refY="5" orient="auto">
                <polygon points="0 0, 10 5, 0 10" fill="#10b981"/>
              </marker>
            </defs>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="workflow-description">
          <strong>Loop Logic:</strong> Executor analyzes → Evaluator scores & checks completeness → If gaps found: Critic identifies issues → Improver refines → loop back. When all 4 angles covered + risk flags present: exit to Final Reviewer.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- EXECUTION LOG -->
      <div class="execution-section">
        <div class="section-title">📋 Execution Log</div>
        <div class="execution-log" id="executionLog">
          <div class="log-entry">Waiting for analysis to start...</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ANALYSIS OUTPUT -->
      <div class="analysis-output" id="analysisOutput" class="hidden">
        <div class="section-title">📈 Current Analysis Draft</div>
        <div id="analysisContent"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT PANEL (SIDEBAR) -->
    <div class="right-panel">
      <!-- KEY METRICS -->
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">📊 Key Metrics</div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Current Round</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="currentRound">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Depth Score</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="depthScore">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Angles Covered</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="anglesCovered">0/4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Risk Flags</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="riskFlags">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Stop Reason</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="stopReason">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-container">
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill" style="--width: 0%;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AGENT STATUS -->
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">🤖 Agent Status</div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Executor</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="agentExecutor">Waiting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Evaluator</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="agentEvaluator">Waiting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Critic</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="agentCritic">Waiting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Improver</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="agentImprover">Waiting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Final Reviewer</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="agentFinal">Waiting</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ITERATION HISTORY -->
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">📚 Iteration History</div>
        <div id="iterationHistory"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- STOP CONDITION CHECKLIST -->
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">✅ Stop Conditions</div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">All 4 Angles</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="checkAngles">Pending</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Risk Flags Found</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="checkRisks">Pending</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Plateau Check</span>
          <span class="badge badge-info" id="checkPlateau">Monitoring</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">Iteration Cap</span>
          <span class="badge badge-warning" id="checkCap">8 Max</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
// ==================== STATE ====================
const state = {
  running: false,
  round: 0,
  csvData: '',
  iterations: [],
  currentScore: 0,
  prevScore: 0,
  anglesCovered: [],
  riskFlagsFound: false,
  plateauRounds: 0,
  stopReason: null,
  analysisHistory: [],
  currentAnalysis: ''
};

// ==================== SYSTEM PROMPTS ====================
const systemPrompts = {
  executor: `You are the Executor agent in a multi-agent financial analysis system. Your role is to perform deep financial analysis on provided data.

RESPONSIBILITIES:
- Analyze financial metrics (revenue trends, expense patterns, profit margins)
- Calculate forecasts based on historical data
- Identify seasonal patterns and anomalies
- Generate specific, data-backed insights
- Maintain analytical rigor and clarity

OUTPUT FORMAT:
Return ONLY valid JSON with this structure:
{
  "analysis": "Your detailed financial analysis here",
  "keyMetrics": ["metric1", "metric2", ...],
  "trends": "Description of identified trends",
  "forecasts": "Forecast description with logic",
  "anomalies": "Any unusual patterns or data points"
}`,

  evaluator: `You are the Evaluator agent. Your job is to score the analysis on DEPTH OF INSIGHTS (1-10 scale) and check if completeness criteria are met.

COMPLETENESS CRITERIA (all must be addressed):
1. Trend Analysis — Are historical patterns identified and explained?
2. Forecast Modeling — Are future projections provided with logic?
3. Risk Identification — Are financial risks and red flags surfaced?
4. Root Cause Analysis — Are underlying reasons for patterns explained?

DEPTH SCORING (1-10):
- 1-3: Surface-level, obvious observations only
- 4-5: Basic analysis, some patterns identified, limited depth
- 6-7: Good analysis, most angles covered, solid reasoning
- 8-9: Deep insights, all angles covered, clear root causes
- 10: Exceptional depth, hidden patterns surfaced, comprehensive

OUTPUT FORMAT (ONLY valid JSON):
{
  "depthScore": <1-10>,
  "anglesCovered": ["Trend Analysis", "Forecast Modeling", "Risk Identification", "Root Cause Analysis"] (only include covered angles),
  "riskFlagsIdentified": <true/false>,
  "reasoning": "Why this score",
  "gaps": ["gap1", "gap2"] (what's missing to reach higher score)
}`,

  critic: `You are the Critic agent. Identify specific gaps, weak reasoning, and areas needing deeper analysis.

EVALUATION FOCUS:
- Which angles from the completeness criteria are under-explored?
- What patterns are mentioned but not explained?
- What financial risks are not addressed?
- Where is the reasoning weak or unsupported?

OUTPUT FORMAT (ONLY valid JSON):
{
  "critiques": ["critique1", "critique2", "critique3"],
  "missingAngles": ["angle1", "angle2"],
  "weakReasoningAreas": ["area1", "area2"],
  "priorityGaps": "Most critical gap to fix next"
}`,

  improver: `You 
